eas of  innovations that will let csps earn a  return on their investments in 5g by  offering a secure and dynamic network  platform to enterprises  if you want to read more about these  announcements or see a full list check  out the link any thoughts or ideas leave  us a comment or tweet us we'll see you  in the cloud
 

